      "value": "@{60189fe37ae30b2338042f44|full_name}: I wasn't saying that you were. I think it's just a random thing. To some people it happens more than to others. Probably to some it never happens, and to some it always. My point was that before you could have just used mods to fix some of your problems, among which this. Heck it's possible that not a lot of people raised the issue because it wasn't happening to most of the users because they were using mods. Now you're at the mercy of VRC devs. Note that the problems has been around since 2017: https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vrchat-not-closing",
