  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-02T22:33:47.727Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Steam does not detect when VRChat has quit since the EAC patch. I have tried the live version and open beta. \nClicking \"STOP\" on Steam just says \"STOPPING\" infinitely and does not allow a new instance of the game to be launched.\nThe only solution is to force quit Steam via task manager Since steam is \"waiting for VRChat to shut down\" and reopen it.\nA similar problem can sometimes be observed with other games using EAC such as Elden Ring.",
